OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDocumentary series. Six patients
OL,7,     Fcome in to see the Bradford
OL,8,     Fdoctors about their chronic pain
OL,9,     Fissues.
OL,10,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,11,     FSister Vicky faces a barrage of
OL,12,     Fproblems with no beds in the
OL,13,     Fhospital and the vital red phone
OL,14,     Fout of order. A 10-year-old comes
OL,15,     Fin with a dangerously fast heart
OL,16,     Frate.
OL,17,G2100 A&E After Dark
